If you look at the last example in the help, and modify it a little:

ggparcoord(data = iris, columns = 1:4, groupColumn = 5, order = "anyClass",
+ title = "Parallel Coordinate Plot for the Iris Data",
+ alphaLines = 0.3) + geom_point(colour=I("purple"))

you can get point colour to be different from line colour.

