Jensen,

I can't seem to get the plot to work with your small dataset. The plot is empty.

If you were trying to adjust the axis without removing datapoints and it is a continuous numeric axis you could use coord_cartesian

+coord_cartesian(ylim=c(0.710, 0.713), wise=T)

You'll have to set things manually. "wise" puts in finer tick marks than just zooming in would give you. Try FALSE to see if it still fits your needs.

Brandon

