Subject: Superpose two layers of points with different colour aesthetics
Message-ID: <MEyMz1TMlvU.DdHo4a6f03kJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/MEyMz1TMlvU/m/DdHo4a6f03kJ>
