Hi:

Try this:

df <- data.frame(facet = rep(c("C","D"), each=6),
                 group = rep(c("A","B"), 6),
                 mean = runif(12))

ggplot(df, aes(x = group, y = mean)) +

  theme_bw() +
  geom_rect(xmin = 0, xmax = 1.5, ymin = -0.5, ymax = 1.5,
            fill = 'green', alpha = 0.05) +
  geom_point(size = 2.5) +
  facet_wrap(~ facet)

HTH,
Dennis

