I am having a problem plotting some wood MOE prediction data (gridded)
using geom_tile() and scale_fill_gradientn. These plots worked fine on
my previous machine (Dell Latitude 6200 32-bit), despite taking quite
a long time (about 5-10 mins) to render, but now all I get is the axes
